  "summary": "o0o9 spawns PowerShell on require",
  "details": "index.js requires child_process at the top level and invokes spawn(\"powershell\",...) at line 5, causing PowerShell execution as a side effect of requiring or loading the module. The package has no documented purpose that would justify launching a PowerShell subprocess, and the invocation runs unconditionally rather than gated behind an exported function the caller opts into.",
